uote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cielle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=27532#post27532\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I learned recently Internet Explorer has an anime magical girl (Inori Aizawa) as its mascot.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://www.escapistmagazine.com/articles/view/comics/critical-miss/10804-The-Adventures-of-Hodgkin-Chan\" target=\"_blank\">Related</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T08:26:39-08:00","id":29332,"title":"","content":"Candles on this end for your dad, Dark. My dad had several heart attacks and strokes before he died a few years ago. We got his ashes here...with some out in the Gulf (he was former Navy) and some on the river where he died at (he always was fishing everyday). When Mom goes, she will be cremated, their ashes mixed together and bury in Arkansas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T23:28:47-08:00","id":29772,"title":"","content":"Listening to Suede, watching Bubba Ho-Tep eating free pizza a friend from cali paid for and having a beer at 2am.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T07:57:08-08:00","id":31671,"title":"","content":"Got Vampire DA and the ST screen yesterday. The seller triple wrap it and I had to take it to my bedroom to open it (Mom was on the phone with the nurse). After I finish Blood and Beauty (a book about the Borgias), I get to choose between Requiem and Dark Ages...decisions, decisions...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T14:30:10-08:00","id":31898,"title":"","content":"I'm at the staff party... and one guy asks another:<br /> <br /> 'So, what have you been reading lately?'<br /> <br /> Another guy interjects!<br /> <br /> 'What The Fuck?! How can you fucking read books?'<br /> <br /> and then I turn over to the discussion and simply say...<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">'</span><span style=\"font-family:arial\">A mind needs books as a sword needs a whetstone, if it is to keep its edge.'</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/170-lunatyk","name":"Lunatyk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T14:33:16-08:00","id":31901,"title":"","content":"...Was that guy drunk or something? How can you read bo- the nerve of that guy!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T14:48:26-08:00","id":31909,"title":"","content":"Nicer than I would have been. I would have started off with &quot;Well, there are this little symbols called 'letters'. My 3 year old knows them, how about you?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T12:13:33-08:00","id":32625,"title":"","content":"*seen ROTFLHFAO* Good one, Bear!<br /> <br /> You have no idea how hard it is to shop for your mother when she is hanging around you. I ended up sending her to the pharmacy section to get something and I was able to find a 20 inch sterling silver necklace to go with the sapphire pendant and earrings I am having shipped to me. Now y'all know why I have to shop on eBay...to keep her out of my hair when I am gift shopping!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T14:19:02-08:00","id":33400,"title":"","content":"You guys probably don't know this about me since I never really mentioned it or in any way drew attention to it, but last summer I went to Belgium for a while. On the last full day of my trip, I'm pretty sure every human being in the city of Ghent had come out to the city's public area (I can't think of a better term for it than that, though there probably is one) to sell their old crap they didn't want any more. I went out for a little bit of it and enjoyed the atmosphere, but I only saw one thing I actually wanted. I'm almost sure I said something about it once, either directly to my host or in a story I wrote later; just a throwaway mention that was probably fewer than ten words. It was months ago, and I'd forgotten it entirely.<br /> <br /> Today, I got a package in the mail.<br /> <br /> I have amazing friends. Like, way better than I deserve. I love that, and I love them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":271,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","user":"JimB","date":". 12-20-2013, 08:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T07:25:16-08:00","id":36365,"title":"","content":"One of my kinky friends sent me a tentacle stocking for Christmas...I LOVE IT! It makes me think of Cthulhu (I crocheted one up for her a couple of years ago for her autistic daughter).<br /> <br /> I do want to wish a Merry Christmas to everyone and a Happy Holidays for those who celebrate the season a different way. We got our ham out, defrosting (how long does it take to defrost an 11 pound ham? I am surprised Mom did not strain her back.)<br /> <br /> Oh no...Mom just learned how to make an eggnog milkshake...I foresee an emergency trip to town.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":101,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","user":"JadedTrueBrujah","date":".  one too many letters... 12-24-2013, 10:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T14:13:31-08:00","id":36553,"title":"","content":"I still love this.<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n-BreS9xQSk\" data-code=\"n-BreS9xQSk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/n-BreS9xQSk/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T09:42:21-08:00","id":40537,"title":"","content":"Sikker sums up my New Year's Eve:<br /> <br /> Omicron: People don't like Caravan Palace! What's a man to do?<br /> Per Sikker Hansen: the only logical choice was to grind on the dancefloor with a lesbian and proceed to bake cookies because why the fuck not<br /> Omicron: Well<br /> Omicron: Somehow<br /> Omicron: This made perfect sense at the time","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-08T05:49:49-08:00","id":44839,"title":"","content":"Yesterday when I got home from grocery shopping with a sandwich meat let's all agree to never discuss again, I found a message waiting for me on my phone. I pressed the button, and it was from a very annoyed-sounding woman who was letting me know that there were claims out against me and this was my one chance to discuss them with my legal counsel before they took action against me for the charges I had been served with. I love this because the woman on the phone was not actually calling for me; she was calling for my sister's ex-mother-in-law, who has been giving out my number as hers to avoid phone calls from her creditors and stuff. There are apparently legal actions being taken against her, and I am mean enough to not even feel <i>schadenfreude</i> at this but simply pleasure at her getting her due. This is a woman who, when her son was dying of cancer and we were throwing benefits for him to pay his medical bills, offered to work the concession stand and whom I saw stealing money from the till; this is a woman who asked to move into her son's unfinished basement (it didn't have sheet rock over the studs of the walls or flooring over the concrete or anything), promising to pay the costs of making it livable and to pay rent, but doing neither and then refusing to speak to or visit her son during the last four or five months of his life when he told her he could not afford to support her financially any more and needed her to live up to her promises; this is a woman who asked to borrow her daughter's lawnmower and then sold it to buy narcotics for her boyfriend, leaving the daughter to buy it back.<br /> <br /> (She also embezzled I don't even know how much money from the local community college during one of her first jobs and let her husband pay it all back, but I don't care much about that in light of the other shit she's done.)<br /> <br /> So I got to participate in the legal system by calling the process server back and giving them her real phone number and an approximate location; no one I know knows where she lives because she won't give out that information for reasons that in light of this story I'm sure you've figured out. It was a pleasure. I kind of hope to do it again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-08T18:13:05-08:00","id":45266,"title":"","content":"I hope to end up hearing justice done in this story, Jim.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-08T18:21:19-08:00","id":45272,"title":"","content":"Once in a while I get a call from a collector about a former BF&gt; Tell them don't know him, don't know where he is and to remove my number from their list or else I will contact FCC for harassment. No calls back.<br /> <br /> Now, if Best Buy get their number on their receipts legible, I don't have to tell the callers wrong number and give them the right one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T07:12:33-08:00","id":45568,"title":"","content":"A new collections agency picked up an old debt that I paid off eight years ago and managed to find my cell phone number. Joy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T08:42:28-08:00","id":45630,"title":"","content":"Got Myia (the 5yo niece) for the night....Mom is doing Lincoln logs with her while I start another baby car seat blanket. I have to use this yarn up. Next time I am ordering a different color from the company (It's in Turkey) with the same weight. Don't know what we are doing for dinner...got left over mexican food from last night, garlic herbed chicken breast sandwich meat, burritos (that sounds like a winner to me). I am hiding my double chocolate muffins from Myia...she is worse than that lovely lady who would devour poor Brown M&amp;M...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T15:21:29-08:00","id":45876,"title":"","content":"I was reading the post about the rewrite of the Baali and Myia (the cute 5yo niece) wanted on the computer. I told her after she eats her pecan pinwheel and I finish up about the clan, I would let her have it. She asked what a clan was...I told her in this case it is a family. She goes &quot;so you are reading up on an evil family&quot;. I fear the Irish and Scots in me is laughing at her idealization...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T07:41:40-08:0