e":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T05:29:57-08:00","id":48888,"title":"","content":"I love that my copy of Project Twilight came in the mail yesterday and that my best friend has a never ending supply of clever Start Trek jokes. I also love coconut flavored La Croix and shooting zombines on left4dead2.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1819-fallingsnow","name":"FallingSnow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1819_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T19:12:18-08:00","id":49466,"title":"","content":"My mom's surgery went off without a hitch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T19:59:13-08:00","id":49491,"title":"","content":"Good, I'm glad to hear it.<br /> <br /> Also: surgery? Did you mention your mom was headed to surgery?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T20:04:28-08:00","id":49495,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=49491#post49491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Good, I'm glad to hear it.<br /> <br /> Also: surgery? Did you mention your mom was headed to surgery?</div> </div> </div> </div>no I didn't mention anything about it. She's been in pain, lots of pain, for the past few months. She went in for back surgery today for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T20:51:33-08:00","id":49520,"title":"","content":"Ooh, back surgery is scary. Yeah, I'm glad she got out of it without a hitch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T16:30:13-08:00","id":50219,"title":"","content":"Dad had back surgery when I was 9. Got temp disability so he can heal up and the trucking company paid the bills. Used his GI Bill to go to LVN school (I stole his textbooks all the time).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-18T06:23:45-08:00","id":52326,"title":"","content":"Sometimes I have a good idea.<br /> <br /> There'd been a stink in my home for the past few days. I figured it was just the garbage, which I hadn't taken out because garbage day is Friday and I didn't want any of the local dogs getting into it, so I bore with it manfully until yesterday. When I came back home, though, the smell was worse rather than better, so I checked around and found a dead mouse in a mousetrap.<br /> <br /> This was a problem because it had died in a live trap, a box with a tunnel through it and a pressure trigger in the tunnel so that when a mouse steps on the trigger, the tunnel flips and deposits the mouse inside the larger box. There's a tiny, tiny crack between tunnel and box, though, and the mouse had tried to wriggle through it before getting stuck and breaking its neck in its struggles to free itself. It had been stuck there for I'm guessing about three days, based on the smell, and was starting to rot, so the problem was how to get it out from where it was stuck without ripping it in half.<br /> <br /> Its body was too soft to get out on my own--I needed at least two more hands to help push against the sheet metal of the trap to open the gap as wide as I could while using my other two hands to pull on one end of the mouse and push on the other--when I had a thought: if softness is the problem, then I just need to harden the mouse's body.<br /> <br /> I took the trap outside and left it overnight for the mouse's body to freeze. It worked.<br /> <br /> I probably shouldn't be feeling this proud of my mighty and glorious victory over a dead mouse, but I did not spend this morning washing rotten mouse guts out of a metal box today, so I'm calling it a win.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-19T10:12:18-08:00","id":53282,"title":"","content":"You know what I love?<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://nedroid.com/comics/2014-01-17-beartato-politicalroundtable.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-19T15:15:18-08:00","id":53497,"title":"","content":"There was no independent representation!!! I protest on behalf of the Green Party.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/