eonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T19:25:51-08:00","id":57833,"title":"","content":"I love 2nd Edition Exalted. Even with all its flaws. Just love it.<br /> <br /> Less controversial: I love politics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2058-nobody","name":"Nobody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T09:03:16-08:00","id":58115,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nobody</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=57833#post57833\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love 2nd Edition Exalted. Even with all its flaws. Just love it.<br /> <br /> Less controversial: I love politics.</div> </div> </div> </div>Your username is <b>perfect </b>^__^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T13:25:49-08:00","id":58277,"title":"","content":"That Starz is making Outlander and I was able to catch a trailer of it today.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T16:02:05-08:00","id":58379,"title":"","content":"I am in the process of moving to my own place for the first time in forever (cue Frozen music, or not) and my parents are being awesome about it. They helped me move stuff over, they give/lend me some stuff I'll need but they don't use often enough to worry over if they don't have it (I'm 30 minutes away, it's not like they can't get the stuff back if they do, especially given that we used to have to drive an hour just to get to anywhere), and they even bought me a bunch of stuff to help settle in that they didn't have to do. I've been appreciating my parents A LOT lately. I then see some teenaged girl (I think it was a teenaged girl) getting thrown out of a house with the police involved. I've got some of the best parents on the planet and a sudden sight of someone who wasn't so lucky makes me wish more had parents as awesome as mine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: Unless stated otherwise, all examples I give are completely random and almost assuredly pulled from my nethers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1575-dairugger","name":"Dairugger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1575_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T18:52:45-08:00","id":58457,"title":"","content":"I remember my first place...small one bedroom (furnished) with an open closet, smaller kitchen and no space to keep my cooking stuff. No crock pot and no counter top or dishwasher. Electric and water was paid for, had to get a phone and basic cable (which had TMC). Worked from 5 to 10 as a door greeter at Walmart, used my discount to get yarn so I could personalize the place (hubby bought his music and stereo system). He worked night shift at Pizza Hut as a driver so we would get a free pizza often. Slept til 10 or 11 unless my insomnia kicked in then I would crochet. Easy to clean, never used the dining table because it was too large and Monte and me prefer to snuggle on the couch and eat. Not bad for $300 a month back in the late 80s.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"r