rid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T06:48:36-08:00","id":81006,"title":"","content":"The beginning. Just started chatting with this guy. Right now, it's all discovery and figuring out if there's a connection and more. I love this point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1006-widdershawns","name":"widdershawns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1006_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T23:53:40-08:00","id":83814,"title":"","content":"I just had the following conversation with my girlfriend while she was mostly asleep.<br /> <br /> Br: It's past midnight. You need to wake up.<br /> Ev: No it isn't.<br /> Br: Yes it is. Look, your phone says it is, and your phone wouldn't lie to you.<br /> Ev: *<i>falls back asleep</i>*<br /> Br: You need to put your socks and shoes on.<br /> Ev: *<i>while lying on the ground with her arms spread out to the sides</i>* I <i>am!</i><br /> Br: No you're not.<br /> Ev: Where are my socks?<br /> Br: They're right here.<br /> Ev: Why'd you take my socks off?<br /> Br: I didn't. You never actually put them on.<br /> Ev: Yes I <i>did</i>. You took them off. *puts her socks on*<br /> Br: Here, put your shoes on.<br /> Ev: *<i>with wondering in her voice</i>* I couldn't have put my shoes on... they were sitting over there.<br /> Br: Do you want help putting your shoes on?<br