f=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T04:39:40-07:00","id":139193,"title":"","content":"I love the fact that I get along so well with my family and that we're going on a trip to France for two weeks starting Sunday. (5 days in Paris and then the rest in the south of France, can't remember the name of the town we're staying at... Avignon maybe?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>__________________________________________________ ______<br /> Hmmm... a typo when entering my user name? Eh, that works!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/878-rangomguy387","name":"RangomGuy387","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T21:19:51-07:00","id":145265,"title":"","content":"My niece got a bit mauled by a dog a few days ago. I posted about it in the Hate thread. I am posting here to say she is fine now; her face is still pretty swollen in places, but she seems incapable of caring about it because there are just too many good things in life for her to be delighted at right now. Last night, the family went to a school musical performance my elder niece was in, and of course we took the baby along, and she spent the entire time...well, let's just say when the audience started applauding the singers, my niece started clapping back because she was pretty sure, based on how often she receives applause at home, that those hundred and fifty people were all clapping for her. It was pretty adorable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T06:54:51-07:00","id":145634,"title":"","content":"I'm glad that this was the last thread I read this morning. Good to hear, Jim.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T07:55:37-07:00","id":154832,"title":"","content":"Been really busy with my Physiotherapist appointments and been doing those about twice a week since November of last year. So far, I'm at 100 kilos. Down from 108. That is awesome.<br /> <br /> *pokes Google*<br /> <br /> So this is what it says about Kilos to Pounds conversion:<br /> <br /> 108 kilos -- 238 pounds<br /> <br /> 100 kilos -- 220 pounds","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i><span style=\"color:darkred\">Got an angel on the left hand and a devil on the right<br /> She's gonna raise a little hell up in heaven tonight---Vixen</span></i></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:olive\"><i>When you say it's all divine and meant to be<br /> What about your flesh and blood and defiers like me?---Avantasia</i></span></div>","edited":{"userid":821,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/821-rayvin-miyu","user":"Rayvin Miyu","date":". 05-31-2014, 11:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/821-rayvin-miyu","name":"Rayvin Miyu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar821_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T19:05:57-07:00","id":156133,"title":"","content":"Yesterday we went into our new house. It's just framework at the moment, but we got to actually walk around in the inside bit. My eldest has claimed a room, and the wife got to see the awesomeness of The Tree that's to be in our front yard. My kitchen looks awesome already because I can tell how much more room I'm going to have. It was great.<br /> <br /> And today at the local science center otters danced on our heads. There's a viewing bubble in their area and my eldest and I were checking it out and one of the young ones jumped up on it and began chasing its tail. It spun off, climbed on, and repeated the whole craziness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2546-jaellot","name":"jaellot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2546_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T00:36:17-07:00","id":161467,"title":"","content"