ced my &quot;I dont want to play today&quot; thing to my boyfriend(our ST) said that was fine *shock* (NORMALLY it starts a stupid argument when I say i dont want to) and that if I didnt want to actually play in a full capacity i could make a playable NPC bad guy or whatever, something I have been DYING to do for a while. I dont have the confidence to run a game but the idea of working as a CO ST and playing the main bad guy sounds like fun, and maybe will lead into me realizing i can in fact run a game. <br /> <br /> Typing this up i just realized its uh less of a comprimise and more work then if I just made a PC..afterall I'll have to keep in mind the ST's plot in regards to my characters actions, as well as to keep my head in the rules and not overstep to much or throw something at the players they are not ready to handle...Sick me has weird ideas as to whats &quot;easy&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T08:40:53-07:00","id":257294,"title":"","content":"I love chocolate-flavored coffee.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","