ath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-29T08:03:10-07:00","id":295862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DeCarabas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=295790#post295790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What I love?<br /> <br /> That I found you guys again, that is something I love.<br /> <br /> Carabas is back, in case you missed me! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>DeCara! I've asked so many times about you! You've been extremely missed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-29T09:32:18-07:00","id":295928,"title":"","content":"I don't personally know who DeCarabas is, but it always make me want to cry when I see heartwarming scene like this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-29T09:52:06-07:00","id":295944,"title":"","content":"Yeeees I am back.<br /> <br /> I went to the US in July and it occurred to me that I could have met at least one of you guys. Then I realized I had no idea where the new forum was, so that I could talk to you.<br /> <br /> Thanks to Lunatyk I found out (he had told me years ago and I forgot). And now I am back because <i>saudades.</i><br /> <br /> I'm still figuring this forum. How do I get notifications from posts? Where the hell do I input my signature? Where are Jim's stories? Arc's characters? Papa Bear? Odd Canuck? Mr. Gone? Shawn? Hell, even Devilfish and Lox, if they are still around.<br /> <br /> It's good to know I've been missed <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> One more thing: WE CAN LIKE AGAIN, OMG LOVING THE NEW FORUM","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>\u201cThe marquis de Carabas was not a good man, and he knew himself well enough to be perfectly certain that he was not a brave man. He had long since decided that the world, Above or Below, was a place that wished to be deceived, and, to this end, he had named himself from a lie in a fairy tale, and created himself--his clothes, his manner, his carriage--as a grand joke.&quot;</b><br /><br />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4188-decarabas","name":"DeCarabas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-29T10:17:46-07:00","id":295983,"title":"","content":"Notifications are a bit complex and I've never been able to get it to work properly. If you go over to the trouble tickets there's a discussion about signatures... or a few more like, they're in a weird place that I can't recall off the top of my head.<br /> <br /> Stories from various people are scattered about (JimB and Papa Bear write more of 'em than I do)... the Devilfishie and the Lox are not around much... There was a fight and I think Devilfishie opted to take a long break from the forum, and Lox has just kinda drifted off. I still have Evil Plans(tm, pat.pend) to try and find a way to run an Exalted game with them as remote players when the new one finally comes out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-29T10:35:22-07:00","id":295999,"title":"","content":"Ok, I found the posts about Signature and Notifications. And found the subscribe button. Would've bit me in the face if it was a mutant spider.<br /> <br /> Canuck! You are here! You have probably always bee