and joke.&quot;</b><br /><br />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4188-decarabas","name":"DeCarabas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T09:08:35-07:00","id":297172,"title":"","content":"I am! Despite White-Wolf stopped shipping to EU years ago I kept playing <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And reading in english, having my mind set on english and suddenly reading a portuguese word was strange <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> It's a beautiful and unique word. I have many friends across the world and I've put them all using it (the accents are wonderful), it expresses a feeling that no other can in such a complete and perfect manner! <br /> <br /> Bem-vindo de volta ent\u00e3o, visto que a aus\u00eancia foi prolongada <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2435-prophet","name":"Prophet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2435_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"329"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T09:09:09-07:00","id":297173,"title":"","content":"You know what I love? My last post was #300: THIS IS SPARTA!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2435-prophet","name":"Prophet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2435_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"329"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T09:14:20-07:00","id":297176,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prophet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=297172#post297172\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am! Despite White-Wolf stopped shipping to EU years ago I kept playing <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And reading in english, having my mind set on english and suddenly reading a portuguese word was strange <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> It's a beautiful and unique word. I have many friends across the world and I've put them all using it (the accents are wonderful), it expresses a feeling that no other can in such a complete and perfect manner!<br /> <br /> Bem-vindo de volta ent\u00e3o, visto que a aus\u00eancia foi prolongada <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Obrigado! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Sempre bom achar algu\u00e9m da l\u00edngua p\u00e1tria<br /> <br /> And the idea of making foreigners saying saudades is cool. I'm gonna try that, hehe.<br /> <br /> Devir Livrarias actually brought the New World of Darkness to Brasil, so there are copies of at least some of them in portguese. I have Changeling the Lost in port and have seem Vampire and Mage, though not Werewolf nor Geist.<br /> <br /> If you have some interest I might be able help you get them in portuguese for you o/","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>\u201cThe marquis de Carabas was not a good man, and he knew himself well enough to be perfectly certain that he was not a brave man. He had long since decided that the world, Above or Below, was a place that wished to be deceived, and, to this end, he had named himself from a lie in a fairy tale, and created himself--his clothes, his manner, his carriage--as a grand joke.&quot;</b><br /><br />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4188-decarabas","name":"DeCarabas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T09:34:30-07:00","id":297182,"title":"","content":"I appreciate it very much, but no need. I acquire the PDF version through DriveThruRPG or the books through Amazon and English already feels too natural <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It affected me more because I enjoyed going to a Devir Store, or the few others that sold them, browse the books, see the new arrivals etc. it loses it's glamour done over the internet! Oh well, at least I still get them and play, which is important.<br /> <br /> It's fascinating when you try to teach a non-Portuguese speaker the meaning of &quot;Saudade&quot;. They have similar words, but not quite it, it's almost like philosophical quest, since describing a feeling without using it's name or synonyms it's quite difficult. But then having different nationalities and accents apply it is very rewarding and also very funny since it sticks out like a sore thumb :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2435-prophet","name":"Prophet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2435_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"329"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T09:44:32-07:00","id":297192,"title":"","content":"After I read the whole book in english first, the names in portuguese didn't stick. So whenever I am trying to explain Changeling in portuguese I have a hard time, haha.<br /> <br /> Saudade is unique because it encompasses. Since there is not a definition exactly for it. Lunatyk has asked me about something like this before, it was fun trying to explain.<br /> <br /> I even heard that there is no equivalent in other languages because of the way we Brazilians/Portuguese/Latins in general miss people. While Germans, for example, miss <i>seeing</i> someone, or americans may miss <i>speaking</i> to someone, we miss the person as a whole and in the flesh. We miss hugging and kissing and the proximity. That's my theory why Saudade is unique and hard to explain: we miss different.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>\u201cThe marquis de Carabas was not a good man, and he knew himself well enough to be perfectly certain that he was not a brave man. He had long since decided that 