core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> @Katsura We come in all colours and shapes when it comes to skin, from pale white to dark black, but they blue/green eyes and natural blonde/red hair is very rare and uncharacteristic. Nevertheless, with the free movement of people inside EU and immigration from Brasil and Africa, it's hard to say what's typical around this corner by the sea. The typical Portuguese Person would have dark brown hair, a shade of white resembling a light tan and almond eyes, be short in stature but strong bodied. Nowadays is almost impossible to find such a person with all the mix. My father is commonly mistaken for a German or Scandinavian and he is African born and descendant from Portuguese :P<br /> <br /> Speaking of which, you know what I love? The amount of traveling I've been fortunate enough to have done, the amount of cultures I took part in and in how they shaped me, the fact I have friends in many different countries and meeting someone from a place I've never been is always fascinating! I also love different languages (and on this point, unlike everyone I know german is one of my favourite languages as opposed to french which I dislike completely - weird).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2435-prophet","name":"Prophet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2435_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"329"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-31T06:02:30-07:00","id":298050,"title":"","content":"She was blonde, but darkened her hair. Pretty much she naturally looks like more belonging to Northern Europe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My trage