y":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T01:16:44-07:00","id":629693,"title":"","content":"This morning I lost my phone in public transportation. I was pissed : it's a nice phone, and what's more, since I don't put stuff in the cloud (crazy paranoiac that I am) there's a lot of stuff on it that I wouldn't want to loose. Anyhow, I called it without much hope from work, and it turned out that somebody had found it and handed it to the station manager. I went there and got it back without any fuss.<br /> <br /> I just went from stressed out and pissed at myself beyond belief, to completely relieved. Thank you kind soul, whomever you might be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-19T02:15:09-07:00","id":632093,"title":"","content":"I LOVE a clean house....I rearanged my living room to be more gaming friendly in the hopes that a more &quot;gamey&quot; set up would help keep us focused lol...this is what i do at 1 in the morning when i cant sleep...I'm not a fan of the ethernet cable trip wires though lol <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"http://i107.photobucket.com/albums/m314/Dana_Everett/gamesetuppmg_zpslwgtk51a.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-27T10:58:32-07:00","id":641824,"title":"","content":"I was driving down I-70 today, and just outside the Centralia exit I saw two signs in the land between the shoulder of the interstate and the access road running parallel two it. They're vinyl banners, big enough to need two metal rods each to support them; both white backgrounds with three words in Capital red letters on them. The first one reads,<br /> <div align=\"center\">HILARY<br /> TREASON<br /> PRISON<br /> </div> It's a weird-ass sign, but basically comprehensible, I think. I mean, I'm pretty sure I get it. It's the second sign that really confounded me:<br /> <br /> <div align=\"center\">OBAMA<br /> HALF<br /> WHITE<br /> </div> I have no idea what to make of this. I mean, let's all agree right now that we can ignore as irrelevant that the statement is verifiably incorrect; the President has one white grandparent, not a white parent, making him a quarter white, not half. No, the thing that hung me up was trying to figure out why the sign's creator would even say that. What is the purpose of spreading that (mis)information? In the context of its physical proximity to the first sign, I have to assume it's somehow a condemnation, but of what?<br /> <br /> I thought about that a bit while driving, and it occurred to me that maybe the complaint here is one I haven't heard in ages, and then only in fiction: miscegenation. Maybe the person who created that sign is one of those guys who thinks Obama is an abomination because he has all the animal amorality and untameable lusts of the inferior Negro race, but also has inherited the intellect and cunning of the superior white man, so his evil soul has the tools to achieve long-lasting harm. Maybe the guy who made that sign basically thinks President Obama is an Uruk-Hai.<br /> <br /> Then I exploded laughing and haven't really stopped, because it just makes me very, very happy to think the sign's creator put that up as a warning that President Obama bears the white hand of Saruman.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-27T11:40:31-07:00","id":641898,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Maybe the guy who made that sign basically thinks President Obama is an Uruk-Hai. </div> </div> </div>You made my day, thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-27T11:42:09-07:00","id":641901,"title":"","content":"I give it a solid &quot;D&quot; Jim, not only does it fail to scan, fail to rhyme they didn't even include &quot;Burma Shave&quot; at the end.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/ava