comfort effect without the drawbacks of being all one piece.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-02T12:12:06-07:00","id":686041,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial\">etherial</a>- they are amazing are they not? <br /> <br /> odd-canuck - a. I never thought tocheck out the baby fetish stuff, i'm not into that but youre right that would be a good place to find adult baby pajamas lol (for the record if its comfy i dont give a fuck where i bought it from)<br /> <br /> b. I have the fluffy socks, pants combo but i hate waistbands digging into my waist while i sleep <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I need to buy a sleeping bag with sleeves and get it over with cause thats likely what i'm looking for.</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T12:40:57-07:00","id":690150,"title":"","content":"Feeling frustrated or just have the inexplicable itch to be a creeper, classic troll or just an asshole with access to a keyboard and internet connection?<br /> No need to keep your offensive and possibly disturbing thoughts bottled up anymore, because now we can type like we've lost all sense of shame and human decency without ANY actual human consequences!<br /> <br /> If you missed this new wonder created by the folks at Last Week Tonight with John Oliver, I'd like to introduce to you:<br /> <br /> Scream Into The Void<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://screamintothevoid.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://screamintothevoid.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> SCREAM INTO THE VOID </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://screamintothevoid.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://screamintothevoid.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> SCREAM INTO THE VOID </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Type any and every horrible thing your mind produces, if you want, and just hit SCREAM. Your terrible thoughts, thus entered, will be deleted completely and never read by another human being. It's like Twitter and Facebook, except the way they <i>should</i> be.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 10-05-2015, 03:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-09T06:29:09-07:00","id":694806,"title":"","content":"We finally caught our lost cat back after two months!<br /> <br /> Two months of webcams, baits, traps, having someone awake at night, asking help around, catching skunks and fighting racoons. But he's finally back with us. Girlfriend is crying in joy and relief, we were fearing the cold and the snow would get him before we did.<br /> <br /> I might finally sleep tonight, I'm so fu**ing happy!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-09T06:57:57-07:00","id":694856,"title":"","content":"Congratulations are in order.<br /> <br /> Just be gentle with the little guy, he's probably picked up a few weird habits from his time outside. Our cat was lost for about three months and when she got back she mostly stuck to one room and yowled and hissed at anything bigger than her for a few weeks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-09T07:09:58-07:00","id":694877,"title":"","content":"Well the good news is: we know he was mostly hiding. We were feeding him at the entrance of his hiding spot (though he was unreachable....cunning bastard was hiding <i>under an apartment building). </i>So we know he haven't been hunting or playing in the garbage bins.<br /> <br /> But yeah, we isolated him in a single room, with food, water and a litter box. We're taking him for an exam next week to see if he's caught worms or anything weird.<br /> <br /> Man was it hard knowing where he was hiding but basically being unable to do anything to get him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divid