":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T20:32:50-08:00","id":768260,"title":"","content":"I LOVE the sense of pride i get when i fix something i broke on accident...<br /> <br /> Months ago I bricked a cell phone trying to unroot it(oops) gave up on it in frustration. My new phone though super nice has such shitty call quality i cant understand whats being said to me. So i spent all damn day working on the bricked phone and now its working again...I'm soooo happy.now its set up as my cell phone and my nicer phone is just for using to surf the net etc, and i can hot spot off my cell to give to internet when i'm out and about <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> yay me!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-18T16:01:39-08:00","id":768765,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"http://backcomic.com/s/Back5_005_sv4dld.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment b