ore/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-18T09:13:45-08:00","id":811154,"title":"","content":"I love that having my baby girl has made me want to be stronger. I had massive anxiety about learning to drive prior to having her to the point i'd just settled on teh fact i was never going to learn. WELL. the last week I have driven over 100 miles, driving daily. My longest trip was a 30 mile interstate trip(well sorta had to wait till we crossed the bridge and technialy were in our home state before i was allowed to drive as the other states laws prohibit driving with a permit unless the drive has had their liscense for 5 years *Rolls eyes* ), all freeway, at night in the damn rain. <br /> <br /> No anxiety at all, because I want to do this for my daughter, I want to adult for her. I'm not bad either <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'm going to have my liscense by march, I take the test in early febuary with luck i'll pass the first time and have it in febuary, but if not I can always take it again!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"da