"value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-05T21:57:01-07:00","id":1100708,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=1100700#post1100700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Found <a href=\"https://parahumans.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">this spectacular piece of fiction</a> a little while ago and could barely tear myself away from it. Incredibly well written and, for me at least, terribly engaging. Massive series, too, 1,680,000 words.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I love <b>Worm</b>! Such a good novel. Have you heard of that author's other big series, <a href=\"https://pactwebserial.wordpress.com/table-of-contents/\" target=\"_blank\">Pact</a>? One of my favourite Urban Fantasy stories and one of my favourite things to mine for CofD inspiration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-05T22:09:57-07:00","id":1100712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=1100708#post1100708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love <b>Worm</b>! Such a good novel. Have you heard of that author's other big series, <a href=\"https://pactwebserial.wordpress.com/table-of-contents/\" target=\"_blank\">Pact</a>? One of my favourite Urban Fantasy stories and one of my favourite things to mine for CofD inspiration.</div> </div> </div> </div>I started reading it, but I'm trying to take it slow. I read Worm in about a week and I can't afford to cling to my ebook constantly now that summer's out and the kid's home. Got through the first arc, am definitely liking it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-08T21:51:06-07:00","id":1101858,"title":"","content":"I love the differences between British and American English.<br /> <br /> Were it not for our two similar, but different languages, I would have been unable to get childlike glee from eating a crayfish and rocket sandwich for lunch yesterday.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b> Onyx Path Forum Moderator</b></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements