ate":"2017-11-30T14:16:42-08:00","id":1164058,"title":"","content":"I love what Riot is doing with League Of Legends. It will take a lot more to shape the community into something better but, from their side, each setting and lore update is a step through the metamorphosis from hit game made by a minor company into something that deserves to truly last.<br /> <br /> They hired huge writers and artists, invested a lot on things like lore, videos and art and I swear that witnessing this transformation is something that never ceases to surprise me. They are appealing to a wider fanbase and the stuff they're making lately is actually <i>good</i>.<br /> <br /> Bless the day Overwatch came out and hit Riot in the face hard enough to make them wake up and decide to grow.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-08T22:08:07-08:00","id":1166243,"title":"","content":"I love that I just happened to go to the Changeling forum recently and &quot;fell down the rabbit hole&quot; there. But what I really love is the sense of community and excitement. While I wish there'd been more Kiths in