 It\u2019s a diceless, GMless game about life in a post-apocalyptic queer enclave, and I love it with all my heart. It also comes paired with Dream Apart, a game on the same engine about life in a fantasy Jewish village.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://buriedwithoutceremony.com/belongingoutsidebelonging\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://buriedwithoutceremony.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/BWC-Logo.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://buriedwithoutceremony.com/belongingoutsidebelonging\" target=\"_blank\"> Page not found - Buried Without Ceremony </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://buriedwithoutceremony.com/belongingoutsidebelonging\" target=\"_blank\"> https://buriedwithoutceremony.com/belongingoutsidebelonging </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-25T08:00:30-07:00","id":1199373,"title":"","content":"I really love that humans will do so much to support each other in times of need.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T11:21:32-07:00","id":1199770,"title":"","content":"UNESCO. Seriously, they have published so many of their very comprehensive history book online as free PDFs, it's amazing. I wish I had known about them when I was writing papers in university! It may seem like so many people want to see the world burn, but I'm one of the ones who just wants to see the world learn... so the work they have done and made public is just beautiful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T10:07:16-07:00","id":1202638,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=1199770#post1199770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">UNESCO. Seriously, they have published so many of their very comprehensive history book online as free PDFs, it's amazing. I wish I had known about them when I was writing papers in university! It may seem like so many people want to see the world burn, but I'm one of the ones who just wants to see the world learn... so the work they have done and made public is just beautiful.</div> </div> </div> </div>UNESCO belong to the good ones, no doubt about that. They really do what they do to improve the world and they mean every bit of it.<br /> <br /> On another note:<br /> <br /> I love just how candidly happy people are at geek conventions. I enjoy looking at people having a good time there and just show their passions and celebrate the silly hobbies they have. Cosplayers who love getting recognized as the character they're dressed like, those who smile at the sight of a statue, t-shirt or poster of their fandom of choice and people who have never met each other just talk like old friends because they happen to share an interest. Were I a good photographer (which I'm not, just an amateur with a shitty camera), I'd put into reality the idea I have of going to conventions, taking pictures of unaware happy geeks and, after asking them their permission, publish those somewhere as a way to praise what's good about the whole subculture. There's lot of bad things when it comes to the geek community, no doubt, but there's beauty to be found there too","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T16:21:08-07:00","id":1202789,"title":"","content":"Challenges!<br /> <br /> Starting a new assignment at work in a couple weeks (it's only for 4 months but who knows after) and it's in something quite different than my current job, which will be challenging, but also quite interesting.<br /> <br /> It will also make it easier for me to attend Cangames (an Gaming convention in Ottawa) in May so that's a plus.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Project consolidation:<br /> Rough Draft: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1230422-rough-idea-for-a-werewolf-mini-supplement\" target=\"_blank\">Dhole Shifters</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1212511-city-book-seeking-advice\" target=\"_blank\">Ottawa By Night</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1194394-fanon-tribebook-bunyip-wip\" target=\"_blank\">Tribebook Bunyip</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/353881-your-new-revamped-tribes?p=354143#post354143\" target=\"_blank\">Garou Variant</a><br /> In redaction: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1151956-%E1%B9%A3ill%C4%81nu-b%C4%93lu-lasombra-bloodline-feedback-request\" target=\"_blank\">Lasombra Bloodline</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3226-boneguard","name":"Boneguard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T16:42:57-07:00","id":1202801,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Boneguard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=1202789#post1202789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Challenges!<br /> <br /> Starting a new assignment at work in a couple weeks (it's only for 4 months but who knows after) and it's in something quite different than my current job, which will be challenging, but also quite interesting.<br /> <br /> It will also make it easier for me to attend Cangames (an Gaming convention in Ottawa) in May so that's a plus.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have to agree! I've been working on a project that is very different from my 9 to 5 job the last month and loving it. Doing something totally different that love (not that I don't love my regular job) has been super fun and reinvigorating.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-07T17:52:50-07:00","id":1204359,"title":"","content":"Social media reminded me that I wrote this exactly one year ago in another place and I have to say that, by looking at it, I still agree.<br /> <br /> More importantly, it was about that time that this tought made me set myself a goal and do my best to reach it like I haven't done in years. Still trying and I honestly don't know if I'll ever get there, but it's a reason to roll up my sleeves, do something and improve. While I'm enough of a realist to know that the odds of it leading anywhere are quite small, the effort is there and that's something I do love, no matter the highs and lows.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=1202801#post1202801\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Have you ever found something in your life, something dark and beautiful, misshapen and disturbing, yet able to reach to the depths of your souls? Something that is a mirror for all the secret things that have been haunting you since you can remember, something that speaks the language of the nightmares of your childhood and awakens old memories long forgotten?<br /> <br /> For me, that something is <i>Beast: The Primordial</i>. It breathed new life into my approach to horror, made me remember about myself and the things that kept me awake at night when I was a kid more than anything else.<br /> <br /> It allowed me, with my notions, ideas and favorite authors, to confront with my younger self and the powerful simplicity the fantasy that little boy obsessed with monsters had.<br /> <br /> I swear I\u2019ll love and defend that game till the end of my days. It had a difficult birth and wears the scars of its revisions, but I adore it neverthless.<br /> <br /> My not-so-secret dream is being able to write for the gameline someday.<br /> <br /> Thanks for everything, Beast<br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 04-07-2018, 09:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-08T10:46:52-07:00","id":1204623,"title":"","content":"My partner and I have been sporadically doing short freeform Requiem roleplays for a while now, and we\u2019ve recently decided we\u2019re going to compile the scenes, touch them up a bit, write some new ones to bridge some of the gaps, and make a comic out of them. So, that\u2019s something I love.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Trying to convince them to let me describe it as a \u201cSlice of Unlife,\u201d but they are not fond of puns.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 04-08-2018, 01:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"