c rock (80's and 90's) and vintage rock (60's and 70's) music, it may be old but even the obscure forgotten stuff and the supposedly forgettable pop hits from those eras are a lot more enjoyable than the stuff of today, at least in my personal opinion.</div> </div> </div> </div>They have the benefit of time. We\u2019ve had long enough to identify the best music of past eras and filter out the dross. The best modern music is of comparable quality, and past eras had just as much derivative and forgettable music. We\u2019re just more regularly exposed to the latter with modern music.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-21T16:12:36-08:00","id":1269690,"title":"","content":"I love old-school pro wrestling, especially The Golden Era and The Attitude Era for WWE. I also like WCW, ECW, and Smoky Mountain Wrestling.<br /> <br /> WOO!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LZmyn_Ybx2I&amp;t=59s\" data-code=\"LZmyn_Ybx2I\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/LZmyn_Ybx2I/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/m