 Superman battling obvious stand-ins for the KKK is great enough, but even the cereal commercials interrupting his adventures are so wholesome it\u2019s almost surreal.<br /> <br /> \u201cBe careful pouring your Kellogg\u2019s Pep - you don\u2019t want to waste any.\u201d The announcer instructs the children listening in on how some crushed strawberries in the bowl can make the cereal a real \u201cdouble-header,\u201d but stresses how important it is that it not go to waste. Supervise your sibling as they pour it. Tell your parents, even! We can\u2019t just think of ourselves - we\u2019re sending cereal grain to the fellas and gals overseas, too! <br /> <br /> It\u2019s certainly refreshing to hear a company give a shit about what you do with their product once you\u2019ve spent your money on it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 06-19-2020, 09:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-19T07:14:05-07:00","id":1397503,"title":"","content":"Don't forget to collect the comic buttons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T05:35:36-07:00","id":1397689,"title":"","content":"Hell of a lot of statues getting pul