tent":"A friend of mine was acting as a sounding board for some difficulty I was having. He made an observation, which I decided I would entertain as a hypothesis. Kind of funny, having to do with someone getting their Supply at other people's expense. And there it was, the evidence, immediately after I returned from the conversation to reexamine what was happening.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-09T16:01:38-08:00","id":1470081,"title":"","content":"I can present proof of vaccination without the QR being scanned in order to attend a Christmas Party. Now, I don't feel like an asshole for making Sweetie miss such an occasion (even though she has basically the same principled position on the right to privacy).<br /> <br /> I think that the concept for the male character in a self-contained short story is slotting itself together in my head. I will probably pop on a YouTube video about Dan Harmon's Story Circle as I drift off to sleep and then hit the pad at the first opportunity tomorrow. Was that ever a long writer's block. Glad it's done.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":26467,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","user":"HorizonParty2021","date":". 12-09-2021, 07:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-09T10:46:47-08:00","id":1472136,"title":"","content":"Finally decided I am quitting my job at end of the academic year and pivoting to something new. Immensely scary thing to do during a pandemic, but it has lifted a huge weight off my shoulders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-10T16:38:50-08:00","id":1472208,"title":"","content":"I really love Aimer's Zankyou Sanka. I may not watch Demon Slayer, but there is something so... uplifting in this song, the music on its own makes me feel better. Which is good after having a period where I only heard serious and/or melancholic songs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-04T16:59:32-08:00","id":1475812,"title":"","content":"I have been really loving Elden Ring this past week or so. It's like a wonderful cross section of things I've wanted out of From Software games and open world games rolled together in a very pretty package where dudes who are losing a fight cut off their arms so that they can stick dragon heads onto the stump.<br /> <br /> One of the things that are especially doing it for me? I sense that when I go delving into random caves, I'll find something distinct and interesting in there; specific and valuable treasures guarded by monsters that look and fight differently from everything else, and more of the lore revealed through both the items and environmental storytelling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-05T18:27:13-08:00","id":1475867,"title":"","content":"Despite all the many flaws (and they're many), I loved Pok\u00e9mon Sword/Shield.<br /> <br /> Behind the severe consequences of rushing development, the basis and premises are simply fantastic. It is one of the best world building in the series, an excellent and refreshing plot and magnificent character development. Of course, it takes some time to realize that due to the bad and limited level design, rushed and uninvolved storytelling, lack of different skins for NPCs, and so on, but even then it is amazing.<br /> <br /> Not that it is my favorite one. Ultra Sun/Moon stand at the top for me, with Let's Go Eevee second (best version of Gen One) and the new Legends: Arceus already third and competing for second spot heavily. But among all the bad blood about Sw/Sh in the internet I find it relevant to say, I really liked it despite it all.<br /> <br /> For context for anyone who cares, I'm a Gen Oner. Didn't played the Japanese versions, but started with Pok\u00e9mon Blue, played Yellow, and still remember the original Gold/Silver as &quot;that new game&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-06T15:15:06-08:00","id":1475944,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=1475812#post1475812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's like a wonderful cross section of things I've wanted out of From Software games and open world games rolled together in a very pretty package where dudes who are losing a fight cut off their arms so that they can stick dragon heads onto the stump.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had to check this out. Sometimes I like just watching the story and cinematics of a game if the boss fights are not necessarily my thing. I remember fighting the Kayran in Witcher 2. I had to mess around with my mouse settings to be able to defeat the thing, making sure to create a save right after that i could use for my other playthroughs. Bloodborne, which I only watched, was visually impressive and had an intriguing story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":26467,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","user":"HorizonParty2021","date":". 03-06-2022, 06:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-06T15:17:45-08:00","id":1475945,"title":"","content":"In a ten minute chess game, checkmating my opponent with 0.3 seconds on the clock.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-21T15:48:07-07:00","id":1476894,"title":"","content":"Two people I have high regard for, both YouTubers:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/whatdamath\" target=\"_blank\">Anton Petrov</a> runs an Astronomy Channel and always starts by saying, &quot;Hello wonderful person.&quot;. He recently announced the loss of his infant son due to sudden infant death syndrome. In the same video in which he announced the sad news, he said he was keeping his viewers up to date and explaining the reason he wasn't posting out of professional curtesy. Soon after, he resumed making Astronomy videos with the same regularity as before.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfNeEvXtHF_13OVMyjlU1Pg\" target=\"_blank\">Love, Sophia ASMR</a> does light hearted, creative, flirty videos ideal for winding down. In late November, she announced that she was undergoing cancer treatment. One of the videos that followed was shot in the hospital, following surgery. She seems to have recovered.<br /> <br /> .. Correction. In an update, she said she's undergoing radiation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":26467,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","user":"HorizonParty2021","date":". 03-22-2022, 03:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-12T15:51:34-07:00"