p having to call a taxi. Simultaneously, I'm exhausted and craving movement, now at 3 AM. Water some vegetables we just panted and leave <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OfoieUypTKU\" target=\"_blank\">forest drums</a> to play.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-12T10:36:11-07:00","id":1489901,"title":"","content":"Passion fruit. Heck, I love passion fruit. I'm right now drinking a passion fruit soda, I like passion fruit juice, passion fruit ice cream, passion fruit desserts, passion fruit mousse, passion fruit-flavored cookies, anything sweet with passion fruit. Even my sleep and stomachache medicines are passion fruit flavored.<br /> <br /> The one thing I don't understand is how it got to be called passion fruit in English. Around here it is well known for its soothing and sleep-inducing properties (my sleep medicine is actually just passion fruit-flavored food-grade Melatonin, but there are some popular sleeping pills based on passion fruit).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":