17&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T23:16:01-08:00","id":1497610,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=1497534#post1497534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm also find Elon Musk takeover of Twitter entertaining as people are losing there minds of how there platform is being managed and rules could be enforced as folks like Kathy Griffth learned.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I loved seeing Eli Lilly lose billions of dollars in stock valuation because some joker paid 8 bucks for a blue checkmark and then made a fake account using their name and said they were going to be giving away insulin for free. Eli Lilly has said they plan to pursue legal action against Elon Musk because of their losses, as that exact scenario had been predicted by Twitter in the event that they allowed unverified users to get verified accounts, but was ignored and implemented anyway.<br /> <br /> Eli Lilly losing billions is great. Elon Musk getting sued for billions to recoup that loss is great. And Eli Lilly saying that maybe they'll reduce the price of insulin is great. If that happens it will be a win/win/win for the American people. And yeah, I love reveling in the pain of rich billionaire assholes and pharmaceutical companies losing unimaginable amounts of money. Fuck those guys. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I am curious what's going to happen with Twitter though. I understand they have less than 10% of their workforce remaining after everyone else was fired or quit, and for the most part, the only workers still remaining are on H1B visas or people who can't afford to immediately lose their health insurance by leaving, but they're all in the process of looking for jobs somewhere else.<br /> <br /> Really, I don't know what Musk can do to attract anyone to the company after everyone's seen what a dumpster fire it's turning into. Advertisers are starting to flee because they don't want to be associated with that nonsense. And Elon even said in a meeting two weeks ago (even before he sent out that, &quot;Everyone is going to be working hardcore or take 3 months of severance and quit&quot; email) that Twitter declaring bankruptcy in 2023 is very possible. Who wants to jump on board a sinking ship while the captain is drilling holes in the hull?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 11-20-2022, 02:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-20T06:09:47-08:00","id":1497623,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=1497610#post1497610\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I loved seeing Eli Lilly lose billions of dollars in stock valuation because some joker paid 8 bucks for a blue checkmark and then made a fake account using their name and said they were going to be giving away insulin for free. Eli Lilly has said they plan to pursue legal action against Elon Musk because of their losses, as that exact scenario had been predicted by Twitter in the event that they allowed unverified users to get verified accounts, but was ignored and implemented anyway.<br /> <br /> Eli Lilly losing billions is great. Elon Musk getting sued for billions to recoup that loss is great. And Eli Lilly saying that maybe they'll reduce the price of insulin is great. If that happens it will be a win/win/win for the American people. And yeah, I love reveling in the pain of rich billionaire assholes and pharmaceutical companies losing unimaginable amounts of money. Fuck those guys. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I am curious what's going to happen with Twitter though. I understand they have less than 10% of their workforce remaining after everyone else was fired or quit, and for the most part, the only workers still remaining are on H1B visas or people who can't afford to immediately lose their health insurance by leaving, but they're all in the process of looking for jobs somewhere else.<br /> <br /> Really, I don't know what Musk can do to attract anyone to the company after everyone's seen what a dumpster fire it's turning into. Advertisers are starting to flee because they don't want to be associated with that nonsense. And Elon even said in a meeting two weeks ago (even before he sent out that, &quot;Everyone is going to be working hardcore or take 3 months of severance and quit&quot; email) that Twitter declaring bankruptcy in 2023 is very possible. Who wants to jump on board a sinking ship while the captain is drilling holes in the hull?</div> </div> </div> </div>As someone who uses Twitter to advertise books and promote other indie projects and authors, the massive train wreck isn't something I'm fond of. It's something that was a communications platform for a lot of people and made it possible to business in a way that the disintegration of won't make anything better.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-20T12:40:06-08:00","id":1497651,"title":"","content":"Also... all of those H1B visa holders still at Twitter would only have 60 days to get a new job if they quit or get fired, or they risk getting deported (and that 60 days includes a lot of paperwork to inform the government that you're leaving one job for another). Most experts consider the current state of things to be effectively impossible for an H1B visa holder to switch employers until their new employer is 100% locked in to hire them before they leave their old one.<br /> <br /> So all those visa holding Twitter employees aren't just at risk of losing medical insurance. Their legal resident status is essentially something Musk can tank on a whim.<br /> <br /> While yet again, I get why it feels good to think about the silver linings to some recent events... there's a lot of very destructive storm clouds that shouldn't be ignored because of the pretty edges.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-20T18:58:20-08:00","id":1497693,"title":"","content":"Curious to see what comes of Jack Dorsey's BlueSky social media startup. He definitely has more time to pursue it now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-20T20:32:23-08:00","id":1497697,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=1497623#post1497623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As someone who uses Twitter to advertise books and promote other indie projects and authors, the massive train wreck isn't something I'm fond of. It's something that was a communications platform for a lot of people and made it possible to business in a way that the disintegration of won't make anything better.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, it's definitely going to suck for some people, that's for sure. Still, seeing the richest man on the planet flush $44 billion down the toilet while trying to blame leftists because of his own idiocy, and causing other greedy corporations to lose billions in the process, is something I can't help but smile at. Hell, if he ends up losing a controlling share of SpaceX or Tesla when he has to sell stock to pay off his loans, that would be icing on the cake.<br /> <br /> If Twitter was going to go down in flames, I can't think of any better way to see it go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-02T13:40:09-08:00","id":1498633,"title":"","content":"I'd love to see Ben Affleck direct again. I always thought he was a better Director then an Actor myself and would enjoy seeing more films from him in the future or with Matt Damon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-13T23:26:30-08:00","id":1499612,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3535-you-know-what-i-love-mk-i?p=1497534#post1497534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm also find Elon Musk takeover of Twitter entertaining as people are losing there minds of how there platform is being managed and rules could be enforced as folks like Kathy Griffth learned.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean twitters always been a joke, people losing their minds about it need to touch grass. I'd genuinely prefer it not existing from a left wing perspective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-22T13:01:02-08:00","id":1500394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div cl